  "description": "Born in Stockholm in 1980. Studied at the College of Music in Piteå in 1999-2001 and at the Royal College of Music in Stockholm in 2001-2005. Exchange student at Koninklijk Conservatorium in the Hague in 2002-2003. Främst verksam inom kammarmusik. Shortlisted for the Gaudeamus prize in 2002, 2006, 2007 and 2010.",
